<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ app_name }}</title>
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
        body {
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh; margin: 0;
        }
        main { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        p { opacity: 0.7; }
        a { color: #6366f1; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        code {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>{{ app_name }}</h1>
    <p>Welcome — this application runs on the Ions PHP framework.</p>
    <p>
        Edit <code>views/home/index.twig</code> and <code>routes/web.php</code> to get started,
        or read the <a href="https://github.com/tahadeveloper/ions.core/tree/main/docs">documentation</a>.
    </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
